    "text": "5 hours ago Last Thursday’s open mic night at The Nomad Café (just north of Kanab, by the port of entry) was alive with creativity, laughter, and hometown talent. The featured artist for the evening was Kanab’s own Eureka!, who debuted two original songs, Emaline and Gears of War. Photos... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
